    "chunk_text": "embe spreca\u00f0 astih\u00f0 up fornean o\u00f0 \u00feone monan, & aber\u00f0 ealle wolcnu & stormas. Seo lyft \u00f0onne heo astyred bi\u00f0 is wind. Se wind h\u00e6f\u00f0 mislice naman on bocum. \u00d0anon \u00f0e he bl\u00e6w\u00f0, him bi\u00f0 nama gesett. Feower heafodwindas sind; se fyrmesta is easterne wind, Subsolanus gehaten, for\u00f0an \u00f0e he bl\u00e6w\u00f0 Se o\u00f0er heafodwind is su\u00f0erne, Auster gehaten, se astyra\u00f0 wolcnu & ligettu, & mislice cwyld bl\u00e6w\u00f0 Se \u00f0ridda heafodwind hatte zephirus on greciscum gereorde, & on ledenum, fabonius, se bl\u00e6w\u00f0 Se feor\u00f0a heafodwind hatte Septemtrio, se bl\u00e6w\u00f0 nor\u00f0an ceald & snawlic, & wyrc\u00f0 drie wolcnu. \u00deas feower heafodwindas habba\u00f0 betwux him on ymbhwyrfte o\u00f0re eahta windas, \u00e6fre betwux \u00feam \u00de\u00e6ra naman & blawunge, we mihton secgan, gif hit ne \u00f0uhte \u00e6\u00f0ryt to awritenne. Is swa \u00f0eah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere an \u00f0\u00e6ra eahta winda, Aquilo gehaten, se bl\u00e6w\u00f0 nor\u00f0an & eastan, healic & Us \u00f0inc\u00f0 to menigfeald \u00fe\u00e6t we swi\u00f0or embe \u00f0is sprecon. DE PLUUIA. Renas cuma\u00f0 of \u00f0\u00e6re lyfte, \u00feurh Godes mihte. Seo lyft licca\u00f0 & atih\u00f0 \u00feone w\u00e6tan of ealre eor\u00f0an, & of \u00f0\u00e6re s\u00e6, & gegadera\u00f0 to scurum, & \u00feonne We r\u00e6da\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6re bec \u00fee is gehaten Liber regum, \u00fe\u00e6t se witega Helias ab\u00e6de \u00e6",
